Changes from Version 0.1.3 to 0.1.4
 * modernized the R/renv dependency environment
 * replaced NMF/pkgmaker with a local KL-divergence NMF solver
 * fixed mNMF zero initialization and nonconsecutive rank selection
 * bundled Jeffrey Wong's kNN implementation with attribution and references
 * removed imputation and its unused TimeProjection dependency
 * added upstream equivalence and local imputation regression tests

Changes from Version 0.1.2 to 0.1.3
 * added impute_mice_mixed
 * added list_imputations()

Changes from Version 0.1.1 to 0.1.2
 * fixed impute_cm
 * fixed impute_amelia
 * added impute_random
 * added problematic dataset
